    "_comment": "Each Game Boy's eight buttons and its Power, one player each; the pads of the Game Boys the machine does not have are not live. Toggle Link Connection pulls the cables out and puts them back; with three or four Game Boys, Toggle Link Shift and Toggle Link Spacing change which are joined: P1 with P2 (and P3 with P4); shifted, P2 with P3 (and P4 with P1); spaced out, P1 with P3 (and P2 with P4).",
